# Frontend–Backend Compatibility Report

> ✅ = Compatible | ❌ = Mismatch / Missing | ⚠️ = Partial / Needs Attention

---

## 1. Proxy Configuration ✅

[proxy.conf.json](file:///C:/Users/Nagu/OneDrive/Desktop/Frontend-p3/src-1/proxy.conf.json) routes `/api` to `http://localhost:8080`.

**Problem:** The proxy only forwards paths starting with `/api`, but several backend routes don't start with `/api`:
- Auth service routes: `/auth/...`
- Post-feed routes: `/posts/...` and `/feed/...`
- Connection routes: `/connections/...`

**Suggested Fix:** Update [proxy.conf.json](file:///C:/Users/Nagu/OneDrive/Desktop/Frontend-p3/src-1/proxy.conf.json) to add routing rules for all path prefixes:
```json
{
  "/api": { "target": "http://localhost:8080", "secure": false, "changeOrigin": true },
  "/auth": { "target": "http://localhost:8080", "secure": false, "changeOrigin": true },
  "/posts": { "target": "http://localhost:8080", "secure": false, "changeOrigin": true },
  "/feed": { "target": "http://localhost:8080", "secure": false, "changeOrigin": true },
  "/connections": { "target": "http://localhost:8080", "secure": false, "changeOrigin": true }
}
```

