## 2. Auth Service ([auth.service.ts](file:///C:/Users/Nagu/OneDrive/Desktop/Frontend-p3/src-1/src/app/core/services/auth.service.ts)) ❌

| Frontend Call | Frontend URL | Backend Actual URL | Status |
|---|---|---|---|
| [register()](file:///c:/Users/Nagu/Rev-Micro-Final/revconnect/auth-service/src/main/java/com/revconnect/authservice/controller/AuthController.java#19-25) | `POST /api/auth/register` | `POST /auth/register` | ❌ Wrong prefix |
| [login()](file:///C:/Users/Nagu/OneDrive/Desktop/Frontend-p3/src-1/src/app/core/services/auth.service.ts#23-28) | `POST /api/auth/login` | `POST /auth/login` | ❌ Wrong prefix |
| [getSecurityQuestion()](file:///c:/Users/Nagu/Rev-Micro-Final/revconnect/auth-service/src/main/java/com/revconnect/authservice/controller/AuthController.java#48-54) | `GET /api/auth/security-question/{email}` | `GET /auth/security-question/{username}` | ❌ Wrong prefix + param name |
| [verifySecurityAnswer()](file:///C:/Users/Nagu/OneDrive/Desktop/Frontend-p3/src-1/src/app/core/services/auth.service.ts#65-68) | `POST /api/auth/verify-security-answer` | `POST /auth/validate-answer` | ❌ Wrong path + prefix |
| [logout()](file:///c:/Users/Nagu/Rev-Micro-Final/revconnect/auth-service/src/main/java/com/revconnect/authservice/controller/AuthController.java#40-47) | Not calling backend | `POST /auth/logout` | ⚠️ Only clears localStorage, no backend call |
| refresh token | Not implemented | `POST /auth/refresh` | ⚠️ Not implemented in frontend |
| reset password | Not implemented | `POST /auth/reset-password` | ⚠️ Not implemented in frontend |

**Suggested Fixes:**
- Change all `/api/auth/...` to `/auth/...`
- Rename [verifySecurityAnswer()](file:///C:/Users/Nagu/OneDrive/Desktop/Frontend-p3/src-1/src/app/core/services/auth.service.ts#65-68) URL from `/api/auth/verify-security-answer` → `/auth/validate-answer`
- The [getSecurityQuestion()](file:///c:/Users/Nagu/Rev-Micro-Final/revconnect/auth-service/src/main/java/com/revconnect/authservice/controller/AuthController.java#48-54) call passes `email` but backend uses `username` — make sure you pass `username`

**Request Body Mismatch — Login:**
```
Frontend sends:   { "usernameOrEmail": "...", "password": "..." }
Backend expects:  { "identifier": "...", "password": "..." }
```
Rename the field `usernameOrEmail` → `identifier` in the login payload.

**Response Wrapper Mismatch:**
- Frontend expects responses wrapped in `ApiResponse<T>` (with `success`, `data`, `message`, `timestamp` fields)
- Backend `auth-service` returns [AuthResponse](file:///C:/Users/Nagu/OneDrive/Desktop/Frontend-p3/src-1/src/app/shared/models/models.ts#70-81) **directly** (NOT wrapped in [ApiResponse](file:///C:/Users/Nagu/OneDrive/Desktop/Frontend-p3/src-1/src/app/shared/models/models.ts#82-88))
- **Fix:** Either unwrap in the service (use [res](file:///c:/Users/Nagu/Rev-Micro-Final/revconnect/auth-service/src/main/java/com/revconnect/authservice/controller/AuthController.java#33-39) instead of `res.data`) or update the frontend model

