## 4. Connection Service ([connection.service.ts](file:///C:/Users/Nagu/OneDrive/Desktop/Frontend-p3/src-1/src/app/core/services/connection.service.ts)) ❌

| Frontend Call | Frontend URL | Backend Actual URL | Status |
|---|---|---|---|
| [sendRequest()](file:///C:/Users/Nagu/OneDrive/Desktop/Frontend-p3/src-1/src/app/core/services/connection.service.ts#10-13) | `POST /api/connections/request/{recipientId}` | `POST /connections/request` (body: `{senderId, receiverId}`) | ❌ Wrong path + wrong method pattern |
| [acceptRequest()](file:///c:/Users/Nagu/Rev-Micro-Final/revconnect/connection-service/src/main/java/com/revconnect/connectionservice/controller/ConnectionController.java#34-38) | `PUT /api/connections/{id}/accept` | `PUT /connections/accept/{requestId}` | ❌ Wrong path structure |
| [rejectRequest()](file:///C:/Users/Nagu/OneDrive/Desktop/Frontend-p3/src-1/src/app/core/services/connection.service.ts#18-21) | `PUT /api/connections/{id}/reject` | `PUT /connections/reject/{requestId}` | ❌ Wrong path structure |
| [removeConnection()](file:///C:/Users/Nagu/OneDrive/Desktop/Frontend-p3/src-1/src/app/core/services/connection.service.ts#22-25) | `DELETE /api/connections/{id}` | ❌ Does NOT exist in backend | ❌ Missing endpoint |
| [getConnections()](file:///C:/Users/Nagu/OneDrive/Desktop/Frontend-p3/src-1/src/app/core/services/connection.service.ts#26-29) | `GET /api/connections` | ❌ Does NOT exist in backend | ❌ Missing endpoint |
| [getPendingReceived()](file:///C:/Users/Nagu/OneDrive/Desktop/Frontend-p3/src-1/src/app/core/services/connection.service.ts#30-33) | `GET /api/connections/pending/received` | ❌ Does NOT exist in backend | ❌ Missing endpoint |
| [getPendingSent()](file:///C:/Users/Nagu/OneDrive/Desktop/Frontend-p3/src-1/src/app/core/services/connection.service.ts#34-37) | `GET /api/connections/pending/sent` | ❌ Does NOT exist in backend | ❌ Missing endpoint |

**Suggested Fixes:**
- Fix URL prefix: `/api/connections/...` → `/connections/...`
- [sendRequest()](file:///C:/Users/Nagu/OneDrive/Desktop/Frontend-p3/src-1/src/app/core/services/connection.service.ts#10-13) body: backend expects a JSON body `{ "senderId": X, "receiverId": Y }`, not a URL path param
- Fix path patterns for accept/reject:
  - Frontend: `PUT /api/connections/{id}/accept` → Backend: `PUT /connections/accept/{requestId}`
  - Frontend: `PUT /api/connections/{id}/reject` → Backend: `PUT /connections/reject/{requestId}`
- For followers/following, use the actual backend endpoints: `GET /connections/followers/{userId}` and `GET /connections/following/{userId}`

