## 7. Frontend Models vs Backend Response ⚠️

| Frontend Model | Issue |
|---|---|
| `User.id` | Backend returns `userId`, not [id](file:///c:/Users/Nagu/Rev-Micro-Final/revconnect/auth-service/src/main/java/com/revconnect/authservice/controller/AuthController.java#55-62) |
| `User.displayName` | Backend [UserProfile](file:///c:/Users/Nagu/Rev-Micro-Final/revconnect/user-service/src/main/java/com/revconnect/userservice/controller/UserProfileController.java#34-38) has no `displayName` field |
| `User.followersCount` / `followingCount` | Not present in backend `UserProfileResponse` |
| `User.isFollowing` | Not present in backend response |
| `Post.author` (User object) | Backend [PostResponse](file:///c:/Users/Nagu/Rev-Micro-Final/revconnect/post-feed-service/src/main/java/com/revconnect/postfeedservice/dto/PostResponse.java#8-21) only returns `userId`, not full user object |
| `Post.type` / `Post.status` | Not present in backend [PostResponse](file:///c:/Users/Nagu/Rev-Micro-Final/revconnect/post-feed-service/src/main/java/com/revconnect/postfeedservice/dto/PostResponse.java#8-21) |
| `Post.likesCount` / `commentsCount` / `isLiked` | Not present in backend [PostResponse](file:///c:/Users/Nagu/Rev-Micro-Final/revconnect/post-feed-service/src/main/java/com/revconnect/postfeedservice/dto/PostResponse.java#8-21) |
| `ApiResponse<T>` wrapper | Auth-service does NOT wrap responses — user-service, connection-service, interaction-service do NOT use [ApiResponse](file:///C:/Users/Nagu/OneDrive/Desktop/Frontend-p3/src-1/src/app/shared/models/models.ts#82-88) wrapper |

---

## 8. JWT Interceptor ✅

The JWT interceptor correctly attaches the `Authorization: Bearer <token>` header to all outgoing HTTP requests. **This is compatible with standard Spring Security JWT setup.**

---

## Summary of Issues

| Category | ✅ OK | ❌ Broken |
|---|---|---|
| Proxy Config | Partial | Missing route prefixes |
| Auth URLs | 0 | 7 |
| User URLs | 2 | 8 |
| Connection URLs | 0 | 7 |
| Post URLs | 0 | 15 |
| Notification URLs | 0 | 4 |
| Response Models | Partial mismatch | [ApiResponse](file:///C:/Users/Nagu/OneDrive/Desktop/Frontend-p3/src-1/src/app/shared/models/models.ts#82-88) wrapper inconsistency |
| JWT Interceptor | ✅ | — |

> **Overall:** The frontend was designed for a different API contract than what the backend implements. The main issues are: wrong URL prefixes (`/api/posts` vs `/posts`), wrong URL structures for connections/interactions/comments, missing backend endpoints that the frontend depends on, and field name mismatches in request/response payloads.
